# ---------------------------------------------------------------- To Brill

# Out of Deathknell the road passes Calvin Montague, Deathguard Simmer, the
# pumpkin fields and Gordo's road before it reaches Brill: everything there is
# taken and done on this first walk, and Brill is entered from the west, past
# Dillinger, Bartholomew and Holland, then Eleanor's camp, then the square
# (#1046).
