step Tirisfal Pumpkins
  tip The pumpkins grow in the Scarlet-held fields just north-west of the farmhouse.
  tip Careful: Farmers stand close to the pumpkins, so you can pull more than one at once. Scarlet mobs are found around the edges of the farm and a bit to the northwest.
  collect 2846 quest 365.1

