# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Agamand Mills

step Agamand Mills
  tip Follow the road north-west to Agamand Mills. Devlin Agamand walks the graveyard south of the mills; Nissa, Gregor and Thurman Agamand haunt the mills themselves. Rattlecage and Cracked Skull Soldiers drop the ribs, Darkeye Bonecasters the skulls, and any of them may drop A Letter to Yvette.
  tip Careful: Rotting undead and Darkeye Bonecasters near the Agamands can join a fight as adds.
