  accept 99153                        -- Ephram Barbaro

# Bandarion Keep for Paladins with Leonid's visit:
# Breton Samuels, Hilda and Ephram stand within 60 yd of Leonid, and the
# Vile Fin lake (13-19,50-61) is on the way down to Shadowvale. c15 wrote the
# keep as a Paladin-only trip of its own from Brill after the west loop and
# back east to the Scarlet camp (about 2,300 yd), then went back to the same
# spot for Leonid (RevUndead c15 read). An Undead Paladin's report (stress
# test): Shadowvale at 8-9 gets you killed; here it is done at 12.
step Paladin: Bandarion Keep
  only Paladin
  tip Breton Samuels waits at the keep's gate beside Leonid.
  turnin 91282                        -- Breton Samuels
  accept 91285

step Paladin: Murlocs at the Gates
  only Paladin
  tip The Vile Fin murlocs lurk on the bluffs just east of the keep and in the camps around the lake to the south-west, on the way down to Shadowvale.
  kill 250283 quest 91285.1           -- Vile Fin Attackers
  kill 250282 quest 91285.2           -- Vile Fin Seers

# Shadowvale's Lurchers, Mystics and elixir bottles are in the big basement
# under the ruined house (only a floor and a few pillars left), not on the
# ground above it: Onrevax's report (#392), and players' notes on quests
# 95314 and 99152 in Forever's quest data put the way down at 12.9,65.7. The
# step goes to the stairs first, so the arrow does not circle the ruins
# overhead. Done after Leonid (RevUndead c13 read): at 9-10 on the west loop
# the Mystics were a risk for every class, and the loop's leg there and back
# was longer than this one from the Whispering Forest.
step Shadowvale
  tip Shadowvale is the hollow at the west edge of the glades, south-west of the Whispering Forest. Go down into the big basement under the ruined house (only a floor and a few pillars left, not the two-storey house): the bottles lie on its floor among the Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics.
  goto 12.9,65.7 "the basement under the ruined house"
  collect 268801 quest 95314.1        -- Below ground
  collect 286269 quest 99153.1        -- the Glowing Crystal Fragment, at the basement's south end
  collect 286259 quest 99152.1        -- the Shadowvale Lurchers and Mystics drop the bones; below ground

step Hilda and Ephram
  tip Back up to the forest's edge south of the keep's gate: Hilda and Ephram take the bones and the crystal.
