  tip The Undercity is under the Ruins of Lordaeron, beside the zeppelin towers. Carendin Halgar is in the Magic Quarter: use the Runes of Summoning on the summoning circle beside him and defeat the voidwalker. Aelthalyste is in the War Quarter. Anastasia Hartwell is in the Magic Quarter too.
  turnin 1473 only Warlock            -- Carendin Halgar
